{"posts":[{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_176","t":"Hi thanks a lot mel for your kind help. I didn't see that initially as a retest because saw it as also a S/R flip. Anyway I have redo my chart and circle the CPs.","a":"bcho018","d":"","n":"#176","p":8,"im":["a71a04e13ed49dca730bee87da2e9ed2d4066566"],"m":176},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_177","t":"Hi guys, I just finished reading all the others' homework today, and this is my first attempt on identifying compression.\n\nI hope the teachers can take a look over my chart, and I will put more charts later.\n\nThank you","a":"Neopips","d":"","n":"#177","p":8,"im":["f566e26ee3ecc0b1516ee3ddd7945ebdf1cd255d"],"m":177},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_178","t":"I'm not a teacher but your work there looks good to me. Keep looking for this everywhere and you'll soon see how great CP is.","a":"beebolbod","d":"","n":"#178","p":8,"im":[],"m":178},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_179","t":"Thank you beebolbod,\n\nI have 2 more charts to show to you guys:\n\nSorry that the 2nd chart had been zoomed out to the max. I just wanna show the first CP into a major \"supply became demand level\".\n\nAll comments are welcomed, thank you,","a":"Neopips","d":"","n":"#179","p":8,"im":["77316401d3152aa004aefb62ebfcfe300d383bb6","87fbde692adec9bb68fbde67d947d43da0238b63"],"m":179},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_180","t":"Hi Binyamin,\n\nI see that you have marked some important retest of a supply or demand area, wich in itself is a way of clearing the supply/demand that was left However, I see different other areas on your chart where CP can be spotted.\n\nAlso remember that, when we hit an important supply zone, ideally we would see some cp on the way up. By CP on the way up I mean that the pockets of demand would have to be cleared on the way up And when we hit an important Demand level, we would ideally recognize CP if the pockets of supply would have been cleared on the way down.\n\nQuoting If about what CP is:\n\n\"CP is, pricing taking out the last decision point and the orders that were left there\"...\n\nI wanted to mention that because, between the areas that you have circled, we can see several Decison Point that were taken out...\n\nCan you see it? To help you out,I will mark one example on your chart and will let you discover the rest\n\nMel","a":"@mel","d":"","n":"#180","p":8,"im":["87dd97829169c73feea31f90e786638c8b4da30f"],"m":180},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_181","t":"@mel\n\nHi Castlerock,\n\nNice work here! Based on your drawing, You did forgot some points here and there but I think that you are able to understand what S/D and CP is.\n\nThere is just one textbook example that you didn't mark, can you look over again and try to find it? A hint that would help you is: textbook cp into S.\n\nBest, Mel","a":"—","d":"","n":"#181","p":8,"im":[],"m":181},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_182","t":"Giving it another try, this time GBPUSD M15..\n\nFeedbacks (positive or negative) are all welcomed guys, thank you..","a":"Neopips","d":"","n":"#182","p":8,"im":["5ff90885ed44c3273344ecd4808f548fe5730ee0"],"m":182},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_183","t":"Hi Mell,Thanks for takeing the time, Will take a look and get back.","a":"castlerock","d":"","n":"#183","p":8,"im":[],"m":183},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_184","t":"Yeah I see what I have missed. Cheers. I will do another one and hopefully will find every CPs and intepret the chart more accurately the next time.","a":"bcho018","d":"","n":"#184","p":8,"im":[],"m":184},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_185","t":"Hi all I have continued marking CPs from my previous chart. I saw mel's writting \"Also remember that, when we hit an important supply zone, ideally we would see some cp on the way up.\" Vice versa so I made an effort to look out for that. The first S zone I mark is not a fresh supply\n\n1st chart is weekly just to show an overview than the analysis was done in H4.","a":"bcho018","d":"","n":"#185","p":8,"im":["d66f1fe00e71a07cda8b69a6f0d8236b11be21d2","8960665f911a7da0c0a69d530d9f1b66818628c9"],"m":185},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_186","t":"Hi Mell, have marked the spot i think you might be looking at and i missed.","a":"castlerock","d":"","n":"#186","p":8,"im":["84bdcba5e0078c29f1ef03fca532a1801abed81a"],"m":186},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_187","t":"Hi Castelrock,\n\nThis wasn't the supply I had in mind. I drew what I meant on a chart for you. Best, Mel","a":"@mel","d":"","n":"#187","p":8,"im":["fd6536df2ccd024c6ddbbf3242ec8e9d4f6405bc"],"m":187},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_188","t":"Please giv some advice n comment.\n\ntq","a":"justinforex","d":"","n":"#188","p":8,"im":["1c4ebca75186b9c11bde6cc58802aa2035b86657","abafe4e09eb41f15744e388c58c42293fd5290af","75a455e14e641db8507fc90024a44dca0ae65f81","406fd79add3d4ec576dd33140db004f23961e96a","ef3cc7a1ce237621f1882af9b43c6f784fb68d44"],"m":188},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_189","t":"Good work Keep it up!","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#189","p":8,"im":[],"m":189},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_190","t":"Yellow TL's mark compression/consumption","a":"HotRod","d":"","n":"#190","p":8,"im":["6d17987335687891a0fb908c773f99025bfeb215","0476d8b913677a32bc2a6de6a6de502ab7e5c967","161cef3d49fbd4a81f76b7993ee988eae1d2b0c8","22c06cf3b65246eac9ef5d6a3c417113f248e054","d0e1526bb757e046253250d9e7efbb2a1485b14b","0ae41afbde30c4f3da89404442db8c17a441e30c","8ffe5524786ee584f35e2cdf5c95f5a225f3f70f","eb8ed74e4d4744ce9841663dc50d616893323330"],"m":190},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_191","t":"castlerock\n\nHi Mel, I see it sticks out like a sore thumb, Thanks.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#191","p":8,"im":[],"m":191},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_192","t":"Beautifully drawn and explained - Textbook stuff","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#192","p":8,"im":[],"m":192},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_193","t":"One the GBPCHF chart shown above, the blue rectangle, based on the sudden drop in prices, seems a supply zone. Then after the drop, meets the bottom of the gap, then slowly starts rising again, but spiking south intermittently (Clearing pockets of demand??) until it reaches approximately about the 1.5040 BRN, hesitates and then goes south...\n\nMy analysis seems a bit crude, but there's always room for improvement....","a":"Springger","d":"","n":"#193","p":8,"im":[],"m":193},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_194","t":"sure there is (room for improvement). so to take the turn from whiteout, can you re-up the chart marking the pockets of demand and showing which ones got cleared?","a":"Harry","d":"","n":"#194","p":8,"im":[],"m":194},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_195","t":"is this a valid CP example?","a":"hornet","d":"","n":"#195","p":8,"im":["a94f638809860f26c596d6ffaec606b2fd0197a6"],"m":195},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_196","t":"There's some CP there, but not all the way","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#196","p":8,"im":["1f975cf29cccc4a3644fa805cbe927f570e9ea3c"],"m":196},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_197","t":"Hello Guys,\n\nMy first post. Many compliments for your website and Teamwork.\n\nBelow my compression HWs, please comments are welcome.\n\nCheers R.","a":"Rogeid16","d":"","n":"#197","p":8,"im":["26086c16d9ef6fc0167e50ed5ffd065c9828ff47","bab603fa5a8166eeedf57b2d56059cc94e9eef39"],"m":197},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_198","t":"Con't Had some problem inserting the files","a":"Rogeid16","d":"","n":"#198","p":8,"im":["e93a3714fd96248b4b1bfb4d557f43cf26b7a01b","934d0ed26f7450d6f881f06755bc86d31076c69f","355e902c3869f9c67865abdc11f10868b693804a"],"m":198},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_199","t":"Hi Rogeid, and welcome\n\nFor your CP charts, I'd like you to be really precise, and not run your CP line through any untested levels. I want you to always be safe in live trading, so it's vital you can spot pockets of clean S/D in your TF\n\nHere's a correction of chart one\n\nI'd like you to correct your other charts too, except the last one- It's perfect:)\n\nBest\n\nIf","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#199","p":8,"im":["7f7ed644854f6ccc0cb74e5aea48a9d9f030a774"],"m":199},{"id":"aboutcompression_p8_200","t":"Hi Ifmyante,\n\nthank you for your time.\n\nBefore I re-submit the other charts, could you pls check example 2. Did I understand you correctly?\n\nTx in advance. R.","a":"Rogeid16","d":"","n":"#200","p":8,"im":["56a7d2972c50917e001b86508a586b6aede4d888"],"m":200}],"images":[{"k":"a71a04e13ed49dca730bee87da2e9ed2d4066566","t":"assets/thumbs/a71a04e13ed49dca730bee87da2e9ed2d4066566.webp","f":"assets/images/a71a04e13ed49dca730bee87da2e9ed2d4066566.jpeg","w":1332,"h":782,"b":101463,"o":"a71a04e13ed49dca730bee87da2e9ed2d4066566.jpeg","p":8,"pid":"aboutcompression_p8_176"},{"k":"f566e26ee3ecc0b1516ee3ddd7945ebdf1cd255d","t":"assets/thumbs/f566e26ee3ecc0b1516ee3ddd7945ebdf1cd255d.webp","f":"assets/images/f566e26ee3ecc0b1516ee3ddd7945ebdf1cd255d.png","w":1002,"h":402,"b":12365,"o":"f566e26ee3ecc0b1516ee3ddd7945ebdf1cd255d.png","p":8,"pid":"aboutcompression_p8_177"},{"k":"77316401d3152aa004aefb62ebfcfe300d383bb6","t":"assets/thumbs/77316401d3152aa004aefb62ebfcfe300d383bb6.webp","f":"assets/images/77316401d3152aa004aefb62ebfcfe300d383bb6.png","w":1002,"h":422,"b":18104,"o":"77316401d3152aa004aefb62ebfcfe300d383bb6.png","p":8,"pid":"aboutcompression_p8_179"},{"k":"87fbde692adec9bb68fbde67d947d43da0238b63","t":"assets/thumbs/87fbde692adec9bb68fbde67d947d43da0238b63.webp","f":"assets/images/87fbde692adec9bb68fbde67d947d43da0238b63.png","w":1002,"h":422,"b":17762,"o":"87fbde692adec9bb68fbde67d947d43da0238b63.png","p":8,"pid":"aboutcompression_p8_179"},{"k":"87dd97829169c73feea31f90e786638c8b4da30f","t":"assets/thumbs/87dd97829169c73feea31f90e786638c8b4da30f.webp","f":"assets/images/87dd97829169c73feea31f90e786638c8b4da30f.jpeg","w":1332,"h":782,"b":115070,"o":"87dd97829169c73feea31f90e786638c8b4da30f.jpeg","p":8,"pid":"aboutcompression_p8_180"},{"k":"5ff90885ed44c3273344ecd4808f548fe5730ee0","t":"assets/thumbs/5ff90885ed44c3273344ecd4808f548fe5730ee0.webp","f":"assets/images/5ff90885ed44c3273344ecd4808f548fe5730ee0.png","w":1002,"h":422,"b":17863,"o":"5ff90885ed44c3273344ecd4808f548fe5730ee0.png","p":8,"pid":"